{"parse":{"title":"个性/审判之剑","pageid":9193,"revid":22452,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%91&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%91&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%91&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>审判之剑</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.AE.A1.E5.88.A4.E4.B9.8B.E5.89.91\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"审判之剑\"><b>审判之剑</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">个性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"个性 审判之剑.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/61/0lf1b5bl6v16jbn5eol9wvoci8jqie7.png/80px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%91.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/61/0lf1b5bl6v16jbn5eol9wvoci8jqie7.png/120px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%91.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/6/61/0lf1b5bl6v16jbn5eol9wvoci8jqie7.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />审判之剑\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"万千祈愿之光\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">万千祈愿之光</font></span></span>]、技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">审判之剑</font></span>]，并为场上合适的友军提供技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">审判之剑•同心</font></span>]。<br />✦场上敌人被施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"审判\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">审判</font></span></span>]时，视为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"强化审判\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">强化审判</font></span></span>]。<br />✦造成的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"物理伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"\">物理伤害</font></span></span>]视为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">魔法伤害</span>]。拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"跳跃\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">跳跃</font></span></span>]，可翻越友军、敌人、中立角色、物品，无视[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"燃烧\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">燃烧</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰冻\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冰冻</font></span></span>]地形格影响。<br />✦攻防属性提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">5%</font>，战斗开始时[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]增加<font color=\"#58cb48\">30</font>点，每回合首次释放[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">审判之剑</font></span>]前，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]增加<font color=\"#58cb48\">20</font>点。<br />✦技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">审判之剑</span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">圣启•最终审判</font></span>]最终伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>，释放前述技能后，自身获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"最终免伤1\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">最终免伤1</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%90%A8%E6%9B%BC%E8%8E%8E%E2%80%A2%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4\" title=\"角色图鉴库/萨曼莎•审判\"><img alt=\"头像 萨曼莎•审判.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/00/tq9svs6jjaytco9y6m2ej7i1ypngce3.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-